      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使不一定能猜中，\n也不需要区分输家与赢家。\n这样的游戏一定能带来优雅又愉快的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2d4b7711048f3d7077db40428dd28a0a497077e831cb017bc9605931e92bafe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
