    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4800766a52a12aae18d7072",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她好像很忙碌……是发生什么事了吗？\n希望她没有太勉强自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1a47f3fcec87261cce290b30c5a85f05519de7c0e878901421ad11471ecc57b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
