    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:306d27782c5c5a8fca112310",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王一杯接着一杯地喝茶，\n努力记住各种牌子的味道。\n然而，她喝的量实在太多了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "662bce8ec895036ecf311b864bf6c8ab89c9dc125d7146934ee693c96928f9f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
