      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我、我喝不下了……\n这个游戏明明是最有希望的……\n“茶若喝太多也会重如石”……唔恶……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc8ca858fe96bcac21c305130e454cee5930e219223dfd92355923befe669e2",
