    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0d443a4a5d07643e28f69dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢你！虽然要准备很多东西，\n还需要找人帮忙，但应该有办法实行！\n我……会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a09ebbd492c7a13e1eb52ffe4771cc4c5ab2f9e47d1043464a6694502eb62f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
