      "uid": "zhcn:6bfe25852f720061d57dbcc8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……樱花千代王似乎想到了什么好点子。\n她高举双手，双眼也闪闪发光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "466a3f09357b692634d1415d64cc0d2217b4d91d91ba327950d081944bf9300e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
