      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aba96f6ec440fd095031d95d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之前……是说“不分胜负的游戏”那次吗？\n我那时候还没搞清楚状况就回答了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c398f6c797a72ff2be6f5e288cee7cc3713e236d80985013d19ebdb34e56f32d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0109/storytimeline_830109002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5a3c292d515830293a3bca7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我问了详情，才知道她是想让\n总是会顾虑到其他人的丸善斯基\n在玩游戏时不用顾虑那么多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "402a90e7d2ec7c3c3c175a0116d46be5812100928c9bfac3edbb28c36f1dbe6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0109/storytimeline_830109002.json",
      "json_path": [
